+
+echo
+echo "ICU for C/C++ $VERSION is ready to be built."
+echo "=== Important Notes: ==="
+
+echo "Data Packaging: $datapackaging"
+echo " This means: $datapackaging_msg"
+echo " To locate data: $datapackaging_howfound"
+
