+#                   the entire string.
+#
+# (.? | $LF $CR)    Match one $Sep instance.  Use .? rather than $Sep because position might be
+#                   at the beginning of the string at this point, and we don't want to fail.
+#                   Can only use {eof} once, and it is used later.
+#
